{"beat": 6, "name": "WHAT TO DO", "text": "A short list, and it's this week's work. First, stop reading a test as worked or didn't. Write down the range the data allows, and if you can't compute a range, treat the test as a story. Next, make the price move on purpose. Small steps, capped at 5%, in both directions, over months, because the fit needs 5 of them and at least 2% of movement before it can say anything. Then price on the range, not the point. The best move on the demo catalog is TH-CASIRO-01 to $37.84, a 5.0% step, worth about $388 a month. The honest version is $20 to $909, with a 4% chance it loses. Decide looking at the whole range. Last, keep a control. Leave one product's price where it is and watch how far it moves on its own over the same weeks. That's your noise floor, and a winner that didn't beat it wasn't a winner.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.116}, {"word": "short", "start": 0.186, "end": 0.406}, {"word": "list,", "start": 0.464, "end": 0.964}, {"word": "and", "start": 1.115, "end": 1.324}, {"word": "it's", "start": 1.393, "end": 1.521}, {"word": "this", "start": 1.567, "end": 1.73}, {"word": "week's", "start": 1.788, "end": 2.02}, {"word": "work.", "start": 2.055, "end": 2.508}, {"word": "First,", "start": 2.891, "end": 3.46}, {"word": "stop", "start": 3.704, "end": 4.029}, {"word": "reading", "start": 4.098, "end": 4.331}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.377, "end": 4.412}, {"word": "test", "start": 4.458, "end": 4.783}, {"word": "as", "start": 4.853, "end": 5.016}, {"word": "worked", "start": 5.132, "end": 5.503}, {"word": "or", "start": 5.654, "end": 5.828}, {"word": "didn't.", "start": 5.909, "end": 6.409}, {"word": "Write", "start": 6.792, "end": 7.059}, {"word": "down", "start": 7.094, "end": 7.291}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.338, "end": 7.407}, {"word": "range", "start": 7.465, "end": 7.802}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.848, "end": 7.93}, {"word": "data", "start": 7.988, "end": 8.301}, {"word": "allow